Z||000000||ChadMan||03-23-2001||12:46 PM||||...to the best car I've ever owned, my '88 Coupe.<P>1)  It turned 120K miles today.<BR>2)  It was five years ago this week that I first saw this beautiful little 88 Coupe...I was looking for a GT at the time, but couldn't pass up the Coupe.<BR>3)  According to the sticker in the door jamb, my car was manufactured in March 88.<P>I've wished for more power and I've wished for A/C, but I couldn't wish for a better car.<P>Am I a frickin' dork for feeling this way about a plane-Jane Duke?  Probably...but if anybody would understand, it's you guys and girls.||||reg||10
